# a_ramp8 replacing a_ramp5 as scorer (0x4d on a_ramp5) resets a_ramp5's own combo: 25k, 175k, a_ramp8 25k, a_ramp5 back to idx 0 (25k), then 150k.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
150 poke info_text_box message_field 3
200 event a_ramp5 ControlBallToLayer2
201 expect n_score == 25000
500 event a_ramp5 ControlBallToLayer2
501 expect n_score == 175000
800 event a_ramp8 ControlBallToLayer2
801 expect n_score == 200000
1100 event a_ramp5 ControlBallToLayer2
1101 expect n_score == 225000
1400 event a_ramp5 ControlBallToLayer2
1401 expect n_score == 375000
1450 quit
